-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陶","place_name_jianti_auto":"陶","place_note":"山西永濟北三十里陶邑鄉","resolved_place_entity_id":5440,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d490-db0e-11ef-b280-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宛","place_name_jianti_auto":"宛","resolved_place_entity_id":376,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d491-db0e-11ef-bd34-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄧","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓","place_note":"河南孟县","resolved_place_entity_id":920,"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d492-db0e-11ef-af14-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，此邓城也]。","context_before":"...战国时，楚怀王伐秦，败于蓝田。韩、魏闻之，南袭楚至邓。又","source_end_index":99,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f3cb31fd-7162-5d9f-a01d-4363e5d7a7b1","source_start_index":80,"source_text":"秦昭襄十六年，司马错取邓，封公子悝于邓"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又《韩世家》：釐王五年，秦拔我宛。《年表》：釐王五年，为...","context_before":"...楚鄙人执之，是也。《秦纪》：昭王十五年，白起攻楚，取宛。","source_end_index":68,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"912cb20f-640c-53e3-9688-c37a6c720ffc","source_start_index":50,"source_text":"十六年，封公子市于宛。市即泾阳君也。"},{"context_after":"昭王二十四年，与楚会穰。汉置穰县，属南阳郡。更始二年，立...","context_before":"...战国时属楚，后为韩邑。《史记》：韩襄王十一年，秦取我穰。","source_end_index":57,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"0a81dfdc-df97-5a98-a4fc-f76d4f46ce4d","source_start_index":39,"source_text":"又秦武王十六年，封魏冉于此，为穰侯。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"2秦燭壽免。魏冉復爲丞相，封於穰與陶，謂之穰侯。又封公子市於宛，公子悝於鄧。","content_fanyi":"秦国烛寿被免去丞相职位。魏冉重新出任丞相，秦昭襄王把穰和陶两地封给他，称他为穰侯。又把宛封给公子市，把邓封给公子悝。","content_jianti_auto":"2秦烛寿免。魏冉复为丞相，封于穰与陶，谓之穰侯。又封公子市于宛，公子悝于邓。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":323,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8ca0d6bd-db0e-11ef-b2bc-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二十四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二十四年","